@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Iniciar Visita

actor "Visitante" as Visitor
participant "CliController" as CLI
participant "VisitorConsole" as Console
participant "MenuVisitor" as Menu
participant "GetUniversityUseCase" as UC

Visitor -> CLI: Iniciar aplicación
activate CLI
CLI -> Console: start()
activate Console
Console -> UC: execute()
activate UC
UC --> Console: universityData
deactivate UC
Console --> Visitor: Mostrar mensaje de bienvenida
Console -> Menu: showMain()
activate Menu
Menu --> Visitor: Mostrar menú principal
deactivate Menu
deactivate Console
deactivate CLI

@enduml
